comments.body:
Why have you combined `text` with shape start? Would not it be better to include opening and closing quotes directly to `text` production:
```
"(["                  return 'STADIUMSTART';
"])"                  return 'STADIUMEND';

%%

vertex
  : idString STADIUMSTART text STADIUMEND
  ;

text
  : QUOTE quoted_text QUOTE
  | unquoted_text
  ;
```
